	(text "SENSOR CIRCUIT GOES HERE (isolated side). Leave this sheet empty in the template.\nAvailable nets (all isolated from host GND):\n  VDD_ISO  3.3 V from U4 (about 300 mA max from the 1 W module, less the isolator side 2)\n  GND_ISO  isolated ground: probe connector shell/shield goes here, never to host GND\n  SDA_ISO / SCL_ISO  I2C through U3, already pulled up (R3/R4 4.7k to VDD_ISO): do not add more pull-ups\n  INT_ISO  sensor interrupt, goes to test pad J5 only (does not cross the barrier)\nRules: parts go in the isolated placement area on the PCB (x 90 to 122.5, outside the NPTH keep-outs).\nProbe connector at the left short edge (x = 90), opposite CN1. Add decoupling per the sensor datasheet.\nSet R1 (R_ID, Sensor Connector sheet) for this sensor type."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
